				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-18T01:43:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-18T01:43:03" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>人型を　撃退し
無事　人命救助に　成功した▽
[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]▼
