		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>男の人『や　やめろ！
ウワァーッ！</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
				Time="2011-10-18T01:43:03" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
				User="ito_hiroto:W00178"
